	(text "C2030 and RF bank at socket. One 100nF at each of five common VCC contacts.\nC2036/37/38 SIERRA ONLY: DNP in Quectel profiles along with their feed links.\nConfirm effective MLCC capacitance at DC bias and full modem internal capacitance.\nLayout must share current across every populated VCC/GND contact and minimize drop.\nNo released four-module burst specification or temperature/thermal qualification yet."
